Package: libmirisdr5
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Library for Mirics-based receivers
 Software support for receivers built on the Mirics MSi2500 and MSi001
 chips, such as the SDRplay RSP1, RSP1B, RSPdx-R2 and RSPduo.
 .
 This package has the shared library and the udev rule that lets users
 open the receivers without root.

Package: libmirisdr5-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libmirisdr5 (= ${binary:Version}), libusb-1.0-0-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: libmirisdr-dev
Conflicts: libmirisdr-dev
Breaks: libmirisdr5 (<< 5.1~)
Replaces: libmirisdr-dev, libmirisdr5 (<< 5.1~)
Description: Library for Mirics-based receivers (development files)
 Software support for receivers built on the Mirics MSi2500 and MSi001
 chips, such as the SDRplay RSP1, RSP1B, RSPdx-R2 and RSPduo.
 .
 This package has the headers, the static library and the pkg-config file.

Package: miri-sdr6
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: libmirisdr5 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: miri-sdr
Conflicts: miri-sdr
Breaks: libmirisdr5 (<< 5.1~)
Replaces: miri-sdr, libmirisdr5 (<< 5.1~)
Description: Library for Mirics-based receivers (tools)
 Software support for receivers built on the Mirics MSi2500 and MSi001
 chips, such as the SDRplay RSP1, RSP1B, RSPdx-R2 and RSPduo.
 .
 This package has the command line tools: miri_sdr to capture samples,
 miri_fm to demodulate and miri_eeprom for the EEPROM.

Package: soapysdr-module-libmirisdr
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libmirisdr5 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Library for Mirics-based receivers (SoapySDR module)
 Software support for receivers built on the Mirics MSi2500 and MSi001
 chips, such as the SDRplay RSP1, RSP1B, RSPdx-R2 and RSPduo.
 .
 This package has the SoapySDR module, for programs that use the receivers
 with driver=mirisdr.
